<title>USA: Alliance Gaming names Robbins chairman.</title>
<headline>Alliance Gaming names Robbins chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Gaming Corp said that David Robbins, currently a director of the company, will assume the additional post of Chairman.</p>
<p>Robbins has been a director since July 1994, during which time he has actively represented the Company and been involved with its business and strategic direction.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available to disclose who Robbins was replacing as chairman.</p>
</text>
